From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LeavesMC Test CI <ci-test@leavesmc.org>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:19:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Minecraft 26.2 API compatibility

Update Leaves NMS hooks for EntityTypes, ColorCollection-era
block entity types, login packet fields, and field visibility
needed by fakeplayer/replay after the 26.2 Paper rebase.

